5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,It is a pleasure to be here. I believe we should start by understanding how previous projects were actually received by those who used them.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is equally important to know how the loss of space during construction affects our daily operations and timetables.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,We must not forget the people. I am concerned about the burden placed on our remaining staff to maintain these new facilities.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to ensure our timelines are realistic. I suspect we often underestimate the time required for completion and the risks involved.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent start. I shall be looking for the gap between what we budget on paper and the actual market costs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to see where we have failed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I shall look into the timetable records on rooms out of service and the booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will review the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
